{"asset_key":"timeline/env_story_11202340","episode":"timeline","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202340","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232001:":{"text":"奥格的葬礼就快开始了……","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼就快开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x160DBFF26C2B254A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232002:":{"text":"他，会过来吗？","source_cn":"他，会过来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B3D0A9BAB7AF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232003:":{"text":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","source_cn":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC2C3535F7393B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","female":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","variant_male_record_index":"119967","variant_female_record_index":"119968","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120233001:":{"text":"索恩，你果然来了！","source_cn":"索恩，你果然来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EDCB6121DC65C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120233002:":{"text":"我知道你会来。","source_cn":"我知道你会来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542A14AC6DE9B783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120234001:0":{"text":"索恩说，连他自己都不确定到时候会做出什么样的选择。","source_cn":"索恩说，连他自己都不确定到时候会做出什么样的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF444F4C15BD5D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120234002:0":{"text":"不过没关系啦，他应该有自己的计划。","source_cn":"不过没关系啦，他应该有自己的计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE718E47554DB87B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120234003:1":{"text":"啊！那些黑嚎族人把奥格抬走了……","source_cn":"啊！那些黑嚎族人把奥格抬走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E5263D17F2B4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120234004:2":{"text":"这是黑嚎氏族的风俗。族长的葬礼，会由族民们抬着他进入流沙之地。","source_cn":"这是黑嚎氏族的风俗。族长的葬礼，会由族民们抬着他进入流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC829F795362C38F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120234005:1":{"text":"然后把他放在流沙中心，让金黄的流沙包裹着他，一同到达沙漠的最深处。","source_cn":"然后把他放在流沙中心，让金黄的流沙包裹着他，一同到达沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359DF1D31B7A660B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120234006:1":{"text":"黑嚎氏族生于沙漠，也终将葬于沙漠。流沙会吞噬一切，不分善恶，无论好坏。","source_cn":"黑嚎氏族生于沙漠，也终将葬于沙漠。流沙会吞噬一切，不分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE291D43CE28B35B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120234007:1":{"text":"不过现在一切都结束了。希望他能在这片沙漠之中安息。","source_cn":"不过现在一切都结束了。希望他能在这片沙漠之中安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE751B15A5C224B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120234008:1":{"text":"主人你看，库金好像把什么东西挂在了奥格身上……","source_cn":"主人你看，库金好像把什么东西挂在了奥格身上……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE53DE4C7FEEE94BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"主人你看，库金好像把什么东西挂在了奥格身上……","female":"主人你看，库金好像把什么东西挂在了奥格身上……","variant_male_record_index":"119976","variant_female_record_index":"119977","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120234009:1":{"text":"那个莫非就是库金之前说的护途之链？","source_cn":"那个莫非就是库金之前说的护途之链？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E662C229FBBBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120234010:0":{"text":"嗯。如果索恩在的话，他也需要做一样的事情。","source_cn":"嗯。如果索恩在的话，他也需要做一样的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F2B9453C62B7735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120232001:":{"text":"奥格的葬礼就快开始了……","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼